{"title":"Large Copperhead","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .25 | venomDamage: 10 | venomDurationMs: 4e3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=25\">Lv 25</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.2 · 3,750</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-fang\" title=\"Snake Fang - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 13 total, 2–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f1a8cba3a8479382b961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-meat\" title=\"Snake Meat - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15830124444cf29d721.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-knick\" title=\"Snakeskin Knick - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 3–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venom-gland\" title=\"Venom Gland - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/de59cbec471a8d0c3fd8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venom Gland</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"c